<BaseLayout title="Yannic Metz: two founders don't need culture · BHW Conversations" description={description} ogTitle="Yannic Metz · BHW Conversations" ogDescription={description} image="https://bhw.hu/images/conversations/yannic-and-andrii-creative-dock.jpg">
